# Adversarial Content Review — Antigravity Workflow

Adversarial review for non-code content. Always self mode.
Lower scoring thresholds (+1/+3/+5, 1.5x penalty) to avoid over-editing.

## Steps

### Step 1: Read the document

### Step 2: Finder Phase
Use Content Review variant. Look for: unclear writing, factual errors,
inconsistencies, gaps in logical flow, missing audience context.

### Step 3: Adversary Phase
Challenge: "Does this really matter to the target audience?"
1.5x penalty for wrong disproves.

### Step 4: Referee Phase
Final verdict. No Synthesizer — content fixes are subjective.

### Step 5: Present Results

